		(property "Note" "Values follow datasheet Application Circuit 2 (11-20 V in, 10 V backup). VIN straight from the protected input: the 4 mA quiescent draw (no shutdown pin) is accepted parked (2026-10-13), which also keeps the bank topped up so key-on needs no recharge. Bank discharge for unplugging is firmware: lower vshunt and the cell shunts bleed ~0.5 A each (datasheet). CAPGD left open: chrg_status over I2C carries it. EP and SGND both GND; route SGND to the stack's bottom plate."
			(at 35.56 45.72 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
